Subject: Session lab observes frames after their UDP datagrams were sent
Why: Plan 01a17197 step 3 requires crash windows after an answer and uplink update actually leave the process. A successful driver flush only attempts sending: a blocked socket, pacing or flow control may leave the selected frame unsent. Opt-in frame receipts join protected QUIC stream ranges to completed UDP datagrams without allocations or changed batching on the normal path.

